{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "20e0e8316e3f45a2689f687a9733a16f32152aabb84cb57f6ceb626b2a6ad5e9", "ja": "南の島に到着した3人。みんなで記念写真を\n撮ったり、水着に着替えて海に飛び込んだり\nさっそく南の島を満喫する。グラビア撮影で\n先に現地入りしていた美希、律子とも合流、\nアイドル達の楽しいバカンスが始まった。", "zh": "三人抵达南方小岛后，大家马上开始享受南岛\n风情，一起拍纪念照，换上泳装奔进海里。\n众人也跟为了写真集拍摄工作率先抵达当地\n的美希和律子会合，偶像们的欢乐假期\n就此开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "37010f060005b9477cd7d6066d3fd09ff8e1800ab9765dc2deb8f905885c7a42", "ja": "（数時間のフライトの後……。\n飛行機は、南の島に到着した！）", "zh": "（经过数小时的飞行时间后……\n飞机抵达南方小岛了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "2ac9bff9b5b80917ad0526cb9bd39668ebb984575a981c3b82992c575a8bf001", "ja": "とうちゃーっく！\nう～ん、空が青い！　空気がおいしい！", "zh": "到啰──！\n嗯～天空真蓝！空气好清新！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4177f85bd9266353ad161adc0096ebb6bbbc54eb20d29f0103df364aebcf948d", "ja": "さすが南の島ですね～。太陽もキラキラしてるし♪\nそれで、まずは何をしましょうか！", "zh": "真不愧是南方小岛呢～太阳也闪闪发光的♪\n那么，我们要先做什么呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bd106d57c1d5d39fde995cdeab5a823445fd3ab72e22e6d5f983d12e3a43636d", "ja": "写真を撮るのはどうだ？\n事務所から、いいカメラを借りてきてるんだ。", "zh": "先拍张照怎么样？\n我从事务所那里借来了一台不错的相机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "647fb01c46628864dfc2b850a2222394569beb89c18a44f0e2944f88e9e11d2c", "ja": "いいですね！\nみんなで一緒に撮ろう♪", "zh": "好主意！\n大家一起拍吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "18964d066cf006706c5a9f28402ff4ba3e18d1330d9d0c9e3eb61a68bb904806", "ja": "どんなポーズにしよっか。\nみんなで揃えた方がいいよね？", "zh": "要摆什么姿势好呢，\n大家都摆一样的比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "5052dfdf58e4a0fd24eba0368985193251d2a2e7ac179a72f3678ed26e042fdc", "ja": "うーん……ありきたりじゃつまんないよねえ。\n他の人が絶対やらないような、刺激的なのがいいなぁ。", "zh": "嗯……太常见的动作感觉很无趣耶。\n还是那种别人绝对不会做、刺激一点的动作比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "c09a66a120cb1ea7bf0dcb0a764eb1b5c56a6dd7fbfcfec5cd0f625e3811469b", "ja": "そうだ！　ヘン顔とかどうかな！？\nたとえば、こんな感じで……えいっ！", "zh": "对了！扮鬼脸怎么样！？\n像是这种感觉的……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a96b4da09bbcc24f2c6a8153bfd73570d9d3cff86ddb5de33a08c4ce73756201", "ja": "あはははは！　のり子さん、面白～い♪", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！法子太好笑了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "5687120ab7d6c845fdcaac9b83b8314340d6add5d018d7629f91e2982e371e93", "ja": "あは、あはははは……楽しくていいけど、\nアイドルとしてアリなのかな……。", "zh": "啊哈、啊哈哈哈哈……是还挺好玩的啦，\n但我不确定，身为一个偶像这样好不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6e37d604ca0b32df7cfba04c06af6c8d6f598b68d3ae15f1dac5e21176c557f5", "ja": "お笑い番組以外ではやらない方が無難だけど……。\n今回はバカンスだし、何でもアリかもしれないな。", "zh": "除非上搞笑节目，平常最好还是不要做……\n不过毕竟这次是来度假的，放松一下或许也无妨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9a698ec4094247bdf27d9cf46f4eb0cf7f0139ffbbca72ca066daaa050a4b697", "ja": "よし、みんな好きにしていいからな！\n準備はいいか？　……せーの！", "zh": "好，大家可以随意摆出自己喜欢的动作！\n准备好了吗？要拍啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1012_null", "source_sha256": "ba31f6aa3dbf5513f7079addf028954c6edb0ea23705ce0fdbacc0bf6edbd02e", "ja": "パシャ、パシャ、パシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓、喀嚓、喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "dce3459aec312f5f4dd6f70c242e7076b7d1a7720f0f9d70fbd19058264bbca3", "ja": "さてさて、写真も撮ったところで……。\n本番、行っちゃいますか！", "zh": "好啦好啦，现在照片也拍了……\n我们开始切入主题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ca064364908ae1ad5472f193e27507ce6b87f5ab699e46e444be0b164710755f", "ja": "本番？", "zh": "主题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "d58187f754d07f7fe1073a5ead6420c73f7bad58eb6415a3f6892bd7005fdc0d", "ja": "綺麗な海がそこにあるんだもん、\n飛び込まなくちゃ始まらないでしょ！", "zh": "美丽的大海就在那里嘛，\n要跳进去才像开始度假啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3ae5c8e7769b06443cc002cfae57c861337cec384c731ef2f62cee98b6ff7418", "ja": "いいですね～！\nそれじゃあ、みんなで更衣室に……。", "zh": "不错耶～！\n那大家一起到更衣室去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "257f26a7abe01f1e92119aa64742b2a8ceffd4ea88374064fb1c995bdaa5be82", "ja": "ふっふっふっ、甘いね翼。\nアタシは服の下に水着、着てきちゃってるもんね！", "zh": "呵、呵、呵，翼你太天真了。\n我已经把泳装穿在衣服里面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b1fcdbaa6727a5106cfde91ee0b231487051bdadc824ab3714c99357738a6c89", "ja": "あっ、いいな～！", "zh": "啊，真好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2d7ee1f90a53091a78beb9ce1fa1cc7adc9430d236f651b4346c03f3a0f339de", "ja": "ん？\nのり子、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？\n法子，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "4d189efcb6f628e836b480a334debfa2291d2c4617ea0c44529c1060ef83baf4", "ja": "あのさ、{$P$}。\nアタシ、今から服脱ぐから、あっち向いてて……。", "zh": "我说啊，{$P$}。\n我正要脱衣服，你先转过去一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "123c4fd8de2d83b6229512d8a350d6cfe44f79530b59da59c58bf7bc30b3453f", "ja": "え？　でも、下は水着なんだろう？\n別にあっちを向いている必要は……。", "zh": "欸？可是，你里面有穿泳装不是吗？\n我应该没有必要转过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "c871ccab31e1b6dc38ca562e897ed10266d8bfb6e941dd100d85846c45c05bea", "ja": "み、水着でも恥ずかしいものは恥ずかしいの！\nいいからあっち向いててってば！", "zh": "就、就算有穿泳装我还是会害羞啦！\n别说这么多了快转过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "aac18f4653e9adafd03c0544e86e00a1d6df08b4c8bc6a24d4510c9cbf080854", "ja": "わ、わかった、ごめん……。", "zh": "我、我知道了，抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "4e069f15d44bab5063a6d71860c99c45e0f7cc026388866a5b7281961d58bbfe", "ja": "あはは、怒られちゃいましたね。それじゃ、\n元気を出すお薬です！　お弁当、おひとつどうぞ♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，你惹小法生气了呢。\n那么，这是让人打起精神的药！一份便当，请用♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3a5d48a9971d954a9adb2d1734e80f97af97bdcd56214261234e2d6eb4c8af89", "ja": "ありがとう、美奈子。\n……もしかして、わざわざ作ってきたのか？", "zh": "谢谢你，美奈子。\n……难道你是特地做好带来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "70534c1e4363ce194c754bece2063eb22a35581cb725d1c1b43dff2722e9ca3d", "ja": "みんな、機内食だけじゃ物足りないかなーって。\n旅行中だろうと、私の前で腹ペコになんてさせません♪", "zh": "我怕大家光吃飞机餐会不够。\n就算是在旅行中，我也不会让大家在我面前饿肚子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3e0285334701683e4ff54fa882fe300ebeb55fc0b7d5b0fa6bcd39c3529cf093", "ja": "さすが美奈子……と言いたいところだけど、今日くらい\nお世話を忘れて、バカンスを満喫したっていいんだぞ？", "zh": "真不愧是美奈子……虽然我很想夸你，\n但你今天就别忙着照顾大家了，可以好好享受假期啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f89cefce4e227d766bc03b81e4b4d89a97d0bed95debc74d94a6396296f47d0e", "ja": "全力で楽しまないと、良い歌詞だって\n思いつかないだろうからな。", "zh": "毕竟要想出好歌词，\n就得先尽情享受一番才行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "5ab65e59fa22411f44fc0b0a2051ef08987738cde39dbe0e77e5ec24de787702", "ja": "あっ、そうでした……。そのために、バカンスに\n来たんですもんね。じゃあ、私も泳いできます！", "zh": "啊，说得也是……\n我就是为此来度假的嘛。那么，我也来去游个泳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "5aa0badcacc8202e23d1288b182e8444bcaad1ca1f0c4a507edc45fbd5fc1971", "ja": "おーい、2人ともー！\n私も混ぜてー！", "zh": "喂──你们两个──！\n我也要加入──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "acdfeb381ce8411c0872436d0a55be33cbe54c543eb9cf69722fbf4158bcd7ee", "ja": "（みんな、思い思いに\n南の島を楽しんでくれているようだ）", "zh": "（看来每个人都尽情享受着南岛风情呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c1f279ef6c8ef5dda222a5e142356b7c78863721648b8eddee8b6a37ee7298bc", "ja": "あとは、先に来てる美希達と連絡を取って、\n雑誌社が手配したヴィラに案内してもらって……。", "zh": "接下来，要跟先到这里的美希她们联系，\n然后请她们带我们去杂志社安排的度假别墅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "46976b41f8153d815858761edfc6757ca66fc47798e6e9f3a9dcea1c5fdc2693", "ja": "その必要はありませんよ、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "没有这个必要喔，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8f4850f06e2caec56c37df4ba2998f93792c77b5b4cc4f4441974d25a595db8e", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、律子！\nそれに、美希も！", "zh": "咦……啊，律子！\n还有美希也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "a4e6d72143fca8d6b5e8bc9b88f94f32c38fc4d18699724895d9deca6240d440", "ja": "やっほー、{$P$}。\nヒマだったから、こっちから来ちゃったの☆", "zh": "嗨──{$P$}。\n因为美希我们很闲，就先过来找你们了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "072392d3e790faede003723f423e1806e6b6c7dd6ea38a120a8f20e73d2e6b44", "ja": "飛行機の到着時間はわかってましたから。\nついでに、案内係が必要だろうなってことも。", "zh": "我们知道你们的飞机抵达时间，\n而且想说你们应该会需要有人带路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "b44ab57f9cd1552a7e2ee6610b0aa7638b230f58a3b41ef2b8b0e82f1373e404", "ja": "{$P$}遅いの。もっと早く来てたら、\nミキのセクシーな水着姿、見せてあげたのに。あはっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}太慢了，要是你早点到，\n就能让你看看美希的性感泳装了，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "a4c0efcd9c9d1abf39ecebd3ef77c1af4d3d0b817279802f26ec62bc6db59210", "ja": "グラビアなら見本誌で確認するよ。\n雑誌のチェックも、仕事の一環だからな。", "zh": "写真照的话，我从试阅本上就会看到了。\n毕竟检查杂志也是我的工作之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "2ba4883a16798b9400aa22452ba0265ad5bbb160c97868aaaa5d6300671da33b", "ja": "美希の撮影は、順調に進んでますよ。\nチェック、楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "美希的拍摄情形很顺利喔。\n请好好期待之后确认照片的时候吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "dd5e85fd37808ec2c8020d7863e7ad2459eac324b173425e002841126adae95c", "ja": "そういう律子の方は、どうなんだ？　撮影……。", "zh": "那律子你自己呢？拍摄情况如何……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "3ddb09914e081f64b55513fc957565c6369e389cfbe691e2413ef68c749602e6", "ja": "わ、私のことはどうでもいいじゃないですか！\n私は、美希のお目付け役として来たんですから。", "zh": "我、我的部分怎样都好吧！\n因为我是被派来监督美希的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "120d8ea992a894ed43269d12a3ec61f440239f8e7bd079e6bf43bc3a8f5eb587", "ja": "律子、さんのグラビアもいい感じだよ。\nけっこうスタイルいいし、自信持てばいいのに。", "zh": "律子……姊的写真照也不错喔。\n你的身材明明很好，应该要更有自信一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1044_009rit", "source_sha256": "77919138028005beebc9af1590ac85ab41603ed924f809ea402947488aa272ab", "ja": "ちょっと美希、おかしなこと言わないの！　自信なんか\n持てるわけないでしょ、寸胴体型なんだから。", "zh": "等等美希，你别乱讲话！\n我怎么可能对自己这种水桶身材有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "2db8aebdeee25dcfccb0e33a68ebb60a6c2ca4bd9cd26f0d1b6bd13cd51985ed", "ja": "それより{$P$}、のり子達は？\nみんな一緒だったんじゃないんですか？", "zh": "先别说这个了，{$P$}，法子她们呢？\n你们不是一起来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "8f7fffa650d53726b59ca166dfb0d34fc189461807b542c29bfedc87ffcf05a7", "ja": "ああ、向こうで水着になって遊んでるよ。到着と\nほぼ同時……よっぽど楽しみにしてたんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯，她们换了泳装正在前面那边玩呢。\n几乎是刚到这里就跑过去了……她们应该期待很久了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1047_009rit", "source_sha256": "9e3a1d6edc6ae169e787baf18c528875ae88222205309e825fb9d85a421de211", "ja": "なるほど、あそこの……むむ！　3人とも有望ですね。\nグラビアで覇権を取れる可能性があるわ。", "zh": "原来如此，那边的……嗯嗯！三人都很有前途呢。\n颇有藉写真集夺下霸权的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "c2c6c64f58fc40fbceebe182657854838b86c5f1c994b81321991c86f08668a1", "ja": "あ、ああ、うん。\nさすがの分析力だな……。", "zh": "是、是啊，嗯。\n律子真的很擅长分析呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1049_009rit", "source_sha256": "220cc04dd2c8f9f846fa397c62c92d7a2c8845512e3501078fff9ddd2025971a", "ja": "当然です。適材適所、誰にどんな才能があるのか、\n24時間思考を巡らせてますから！", "zh": "那是当然的，所谓人才要适得其所，\n我一天24小时都在不断分析大家拥有的才能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "33aa15f21b8ef330a1a769754da897bab28c0d0e96b62f3abfb7cc65cc6c80a4", "ja": "やっほー、みんな元気そうなの。\nミキもまぜてまぜて☆", "zh": "嗨──大家感觉都好有精神。\n也让美希一起加入嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "4ddde71f96456a0147087e60f73852df03aa70ef924d6fa7e95d7207769198a0", "ja": "ところで、律子。お目付け対象の美希が\n先に行ってしまったみたいだけど……。", "zh": "话说回来，律子。\n你的监视对象美希好像已经跑掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1052_009rit", "source_sha256": "e34b924f77b5afb29fef1ffaa9acecdd320a62d316d83526c53e46fbb412cb68", "ja": "美希ってばまた勝手に……！\nもうっ、服のまま海に飛び込まないの～！", "zh": "美希真是的，又擅自行动……！\n受不了，不要还没换衣服就跳到海里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "b9da1cff7b2db197e8de7f981d3d33f79b0c658e18408f385def023c916d7e5b", "ja": "（律子と美希とも合流できたし、滑り出しは順調だ）", "zh": "（也成功跟律子及美希会合了，旅程有个顺利的开头。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_02_1054_p", "source_sha256": "68f1fc94f91bed4bf71edb3d269251db1599f54cdae9275b66b1a31e9665c600", "ja": "（けど、本番はこれからだ。3人に良いアイディアが\n浮かぶよう、色々と手助けしてやらないとな）", "zh": "（不过，接下来才是重头戏。我必须想办法协助她们，\n让三人想出关于歌词的好点子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
